    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d633">

                <pb facs="0950" n="830" sameAs="frus:frus1922v01/pg830"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.74/551</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Expert Assistant to the American Delegation at the
                        Conference on the Limitation of Armament</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Squier</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-12-14"><hi rendition="#italic">December 14,
                        1921</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have the honor to transmit herewith a letter<anchor n="4" xml:id="d633-f1"/>
                    from Mr. J. W. Elwood of the Radio Corporation of America inclosing copies of
                    letters of December 7, 1921, to Mr. James R. Sheffield, and December 12, 1921,
                    to the Honorable Elihu Root, relative to communications in the Far East.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">George O. Squier</hi></signed><lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">Major General, U. S. Army</hi></closer>



                <xi:include href="d633-a1.xml" xpointer="d633-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d633-a2.xml" xpointer="d633-a2"/>
            </div>
